  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Rural Development Project of the MO Plain 2, Togo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of the project is to enhance the quality of life of the Togolese population, with a particular focus on women, youths, and other groups in need. Specifically, the project development objective is to boost the yield of rice, maize and soyabeans commodities in the M&#xf4; prefecture by enhancing farmers&#x2019; working conditions and inputs, focusing on innovation, mechanization, modernization, access to relevant infrastructure and capacity building initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
